      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This constant defines an activation function that returns values using the following operation:",
      "ko": "This readonly property returns the [`AVExternalSyncDevice`](avexternalsyncdevice.md) instance you provided in [`follow(_:videoFrameDuration:delegate:)`](avcapturedeviceinput/follow(_:videoframeduration:delegate:).md).",
      "sourceHash": "9981aac84f6ad9e2a42f41769513eea80233d2b2808ab59f24c4a2b13e2051e2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nHardSwish(x) = x * (ReLU6(x + 3.0) * 1.0/6.0)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nHardSwish(x) = x * (ReLU6(x + 3.0) * 1.0/6.0)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "431552e69f4d61aa30af13f55d0c7a42e5f8b8d58562295878c831613741b98b",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
